Third-party components (NOT vendored in this repository; fetched/used separately):

- Project X-Ray / prjxray + its database (f4pga) — used as an external tool for
  locating LUT-INIT config bits; not redistributed here.
- Xilinx Vivado 2025.2 — proprietary build tool; not redistributed.
- Model Context Protocol (MCP) — the mcp/ server exposes the actuator as MCP tools;
  the protocol/SDK are used, not vendored.
- Buildroot ARM cross-toolchain (for firmware/icaphw.c) — used as an external tool.

Portions are copied/ported from the sibling project zynq-xpart and the EBAZ4205
bring-up workspace (same author, same Apache-2.0 terms); those source projects are
never modified by this repository. Generated bitstreams / frame sequences / device
trees are gitignored and not distributed.
